# SKID KIDS: BUZZY (the Mascot's kit), in the school's hornet suit, is the
# Coach's pet: the other team's first bag lies further from them, the
# Coach's items fall on Buzzy's side, and now and then he lobs a water
# balloon at the other team. Special throw RIPPLE, move SPLASH.
game skidkids
wait 5
cheat match 0 1 3 11 0
expect favored == -1
expect bagx1 == 218
cheat match 10 1 3 11 0
expect favored == 0
expect bagx0 == 102
expect bagx1 == 170
cheat freeze 0
cheat freeze 1
cheat freeze 2
cheat freeze 3
cheat rules 15 7 1 0 0
wait 4000
expect n_cballoon >= 1
cheat thaw 0
cheat thaw 1
# the ripple
cheat match 10 1 3 11 0
cheat coach 0
cheat clearbags
cheat freeze 1
cheat freeze 2
cheat freeze 3
cheat play
cheat kid 0 100 100
cheat kid 2 220 100
cheat stars 0 2
cheat give 0 1
hold B 70
wait 2
expect waves == 1
waituntil score0 == 1 100
# the splash
waituntil kst2 == 0 100
cheat clearbags
cheat kid 0 100 60
cheat kid 2 190 60
cheat stars 0 2
press A
wait 5
press A
waituntil puddles == 1 60
expect kst2 == 5
